"Accès refusé par GitHub : le jeton doit avoir « Contents : Read and write » sur ce dépôt":["Access refused by GitHub: the token must have “Contents: Read and write” on this repository","Acceso denegado por GitHub: el token debe tener «Contents: Read and write» en este repositorio","GitHub가 접근을 거부했습니다: 토큰에 이 저장소의 “Contents: Read and write” 권한이 있어야 합니다","Zugriff von GitHub verweigert: Das Token braucht „Contents: Read and write“ für dieses Repository"],
